  "rules": {
    "CONSTRUCTION": {"title":"Construction","content":"The Probe initiates construction and can leave while the building warps in. Except Nexus, Pylon, and Assimilator, standard Protoss structures require a power field to build and operate. A power source is a Pylon or a phased Warp Prism; a technology prerequisite does not itself supply power. Losing power suspends affected production, research, and powered defenses."},
    "PRODUCTION": {"title":"Production","content":"Warp Gate units need a legal powered placement and an available gate cooldown. Warp Gate research does not turn all Gateways into Warp Gates automatically. A Warp Prism is produced by the Robotics Facility, not the Stargate. The Colossus is a ground unit but is also targetable by anti-air weapons."}
